  /// shown through Field.label
  /// beside: "Cancel"
  label "Why — who asked, and how you knew it was them" => "Varför: vem som frågade, och hur du visste att det var de";
  /// PersonPanel · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~73 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "Cancel"
  placeholder "Lost phone; confirmed on a call from her desk number" => "Tappad telefon; bekräftat via samtal från hennes bordsnummer";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Every session they have ends, on every device. They can sign in again." => "Alla deras sessioner avslutas, på alla enheter. De kan logga in igen.";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Their authenticator app and recovery codes stop working; they set it up again at their next sign-in. Do this only when you are sure it is them asking." => "Deras autentiseringsapp och återställningskoder slutar fungera; de ställer in det igen vid nästa inloggning. Gör det bara när du är säker på att det är de som frågar.";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "They can sign in again with the password they had." => "De kan logga in igen med lösenordet de hade.";
  /// PersonPanel · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "They cannot sign in, and every session they have ends. Their work stays theirs." => "De kan inte logga in, och alla deras sessioner avslutas. Deras arbete förblir deras.";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
  text "Give a role" => "Ge en roll";
  /// PersonPanel · text on the page
